nres. His go-to floor fillers include artists like Pitbull and Usher, and he excels at blending styles to keep guests engaged across generations. His favorite events to perform are Weddings and Mitzvahs, where timing, transitions, and energy management are critical to a seamless celebration.<\/p>\n<p>Clients value Alex for his professionalism, organization, and clear communication throughout the planning process, as well as his ability to move a crowd without being cheesy or overdone. From clean transitions to professional sound and lighting, he ensures every detail runs smoothly and stress-free.<\/p>\n<p>Outside of DJing, Alex is currently working toward his commercial pilot\u2019s license with the goal of becoming a Delta pilot<span class=\"gmail_default\">,\u00a0<\/span>bringing the same discipline, preparation, and attention to detail to his events that define his approach to aviation.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Alex \u201cLightning\u201d is an Atlanta-based DJ known for his high energy, sharp crowd awareness, and ability to turn great events into unforgettable experiences. Rather than relying on preset playlists, Alex mixes live and reads the room in real time,\u00a0keeping the energy exactly where it needs to be, whether that means a packed dance floor, an&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-19020","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>DJ Alex \u201cLightning\u201d - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/dj-alex-lightning\/\